OL,3,GNEWSANoxious waste fires near village
OL,4,Aneed to stop - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on the Environment
OL,7,FAgency to stop the "havoc" of noxious
OL,8,Ffires from unauthorised waste burning
OL,9,Fnear a Surrey village.
OL,11,FClaire Coutinho says she wants the
OL,12,Fgovernment organisation to take firmer
OL,13,Flegal action to combat waste fires in
OL,14,FSmallfield.
OL,16,FThe East Surrey MP says she first wrote
OL,17,Fto the Environment Agency on the matter
OL,18,Fin December 2025, but in her most
OL,19,Frecent letter to its area director in
OL,20,FAugust she accused the agency of being
OL,21,F"unable or unwilling" to end the
OL,22,Fproblem.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
