OL,3,GNEWSANoxious waste fires near village
OL,4,Aneed to stop - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, an Environment Agency
OL,7,Fspokesperson insists legal action will
OL,8,Fbe taken if the fires do not stop.
